	(text "TMC2209 MOTOR DRIVER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.68 91.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "046cc59f-0fb8-4bd1-a8f8-cc95bdbe8fc2")
	)
	(text "C9 sits at the driver VS pins (motor supply = USB-PD 15V).\nR5 holds ~EN high (driver off) until the ESP32 drives TMC_EN low;\nfirmware should only enable after PD_PG reads low (15V present).\nRsense 0.11: Irms = VREF/2.5V x 0.325V/(0.11+0.02) / sqrt(2).\nVREF = 5V x 10k/37k = 1.35V -> ~0.96A rms ceiling.\nChange R3/R4 for your motor; UART IRUN only scales down from this.\nJ2 pinout assumes the common 6-pin NEMA17 cable: 1/3 = coil A,\n4/6 = coil B, 2/5 unused. Check coil pairs with a meter."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 195.58 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "32a37fa2-dfa7-44d7-9a91-bb2cde9ea0bf")
	)
	(text "Stepper Connector"
